Fetched when the site is built (not stored in this repository)
---------------------------------------------------------------

The design system, https://github.com/botbenchhq/design-system, at the release
named in upstream.json. tools/fetch-upstream.mjs fetches that commit and the
design system's own sync script copies its dist/ folder, which the build
publishes unchanged under ds/. That copy carries the design system's licence
and its notice of the files it holds from other projects (IBM Plex Sans, IBM
Plex Mono and Lucide icons): ds/LICENSE and ds/NOTICE on the published site.

